==Version history==
Prior to the [[Version 3.20.0#Onslaught|changes to Onslaught in version 3.20.0]], Silver Flask could roll any [[modifier]]s compatible with utility flasks ''except'' for those that granted {{c|mod|X% increased effect}}. The excluded affixes were {{ml|FlaskEffectReducedDuration1}} (old Alchemist's), {{ml|FlaskEffectReducedDuration2}} and {{ml|FlaskEffectReducedDuration3}}. These affixes were not allowed to roll on Silver Flask due to the fact that [[Onslaught]] could not be improved by increasing the effect of flasks.<ref name="Onslaught flask effect" />

{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.21.0|
* Now required character level 27 to use (down from 40). {{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.20.0|
* Onslaught is now a buff, and modifiers to buff effect now apply to Onslaught. This includes flask effect modifiers when Onslaught is provided through a Flask. As such, flask effect modifiers are now able to roll on Silver Flasks.
}}
